  "summary": "将章节合同从概括型大纲升级为包含场景细纲、段落卡片、写作动作调用和反 AI 味剪辑的可执行合同包，并新增公司级写作动作库目录规划。",
  "changes": [
    {
      "type": "create_shared_method",
      "from": "company/proposals/paragraph_director_contract_workflow_2026-05-12_v1.md",
      "to": "company/shared-methods/paragraph_director_contract_workflow_2026-05-12_v1.md",
      "note": "审批后，将段落导演式章节合同流程纳入公司共享方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "create_capability_library",
      "from": "company/proposals/capability_library_blueprint_2026-05-12_v1.md",
      "to": "company/capabilities/README.md and company/capabilities/**",
      "note": "审批后，创建公司级写作动作库正式目录，并按蓝图拆分段落功能、写作动作、风格控制和来源学习规则。"
    },
    {
      "type": "update_template",
      "from": "company/proposals/chapter_contract_paragraph_card_template_2026-05-12_v1.md",
      "to": "company/templates/chapter_contract.template.md",
      "note": "审批后，用段落导演式合同模板替换或扩展现有章节合同模板。"
    },
    {
      "type": "update_charter",
      "target": "company/standards/company_charter.md",
      "note": "审批后，在公司层目录中加入 company/capabilities，并补充段落导演职责、合同门升级规则和版权合规学习边界。"
    },
    {
      "type": "update_writing_rules",
      "target": "company/shared-methods/writing_rules.md",
      "note": "审批后，在章节写作前置条件中加入场景细纲、段落卡片、写作动作调用和反 AI 味自检。"
    },
    {
      "type": "update_glossary",
      "target": "company/glossary/common_terms.md",
      "note": "审批后，新增段落卡片、写作动作库、反 AI 味剪辑、样本来源卡等术语。"
    },
